  "description": {
   "en": "Kamosawa Yuji's representative work: **Xie**—sometimes stylized as Mr. Xie—a series of short stories about a boy and his adventures in the mysterious Platoon City. Join Xie and his crew on their adventures around this bustling city!\n\n---\nA complete collection of stories that ran in monthly manga magazine Garo, Comic Tom, and Bikkuri House. Includes award-winning short story, **Xie's Night Walk**.\n- Kamosawa served as a major influence on [Tamura Shigeru's](https://mangadex.org/author/ef20ec85-4a76-4df7-bca1-e506476f6273/tamura-shigeru) works, and many thematic parallels can be spotted within their respective manga."
  },
